{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "d51ba298-a0d8-46ff-9135-8efe990504a9",
    "name": "Catalogo Productos API",
    "description": "Colección académica para la API REST de catálogo de productos y favoritos.\n\nFlujo sugerido:\n1. Autenticación → Iniciar sesión (usuario) o Iniciar sesión (administrador).\n2. El script de login guarda automáticamente `token`.\n3. Productos públicos no requieren JWT.\n4. Crear/Actualizar/Eliminar productos requieren token de administrador.\n5. Favoritos requieren token de usuario normal.\n\nVariables de entorno: `baseUrl`, `token`, `productId`, `favoriteProductId`.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:3000"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Autenticación",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Registrar usuario",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Registro responde 201', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Respuesta de registro tiene estructura esperada', function () {",
                  "  const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.expect(body).to.have.property('status', 'ok');",
                  "  pm.expect(body).to.have.property('data');",
                  "  pm.expect(body.data).to.have.property('user');",
                  "  pm.expect(body.data.user).to.have.property('id');",
                  "  pm.expect(body.data.user).to.have.property('email');",
                  "  pm.expect(body.data.user).to.have.property('role', 'user');",
                  "  pm.expect(body.data.user).to.not.have.property('password');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Usuario Postman\",\n  \"email\": \"postman.user@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Postman123!\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register",
            "description": "Registra un usuario nuevo. El rol siempre será `user` (no se puede autoasignar `admin`)."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "Registro exitoso (ejemplo)",
              "status": "Created",
              "code": 201,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [
                {
                  "key": "Content-Type",
                  "value": "application/json"
                }
              ],
              "body": "{\n  \"status\": \"ok\",\n  \"message\": \"Usuario registrado correctamente\",\n  \"data\": {\n    \"user\": {\n      \"id\": 10,\n      \"name\": \"Usuario Postman\",\n      \"email\": \"postman.user@example.com\",\n      \"role\": \"user\",\n      \"createdAt\": \"2026-11-19T00:00:00.000Z\",\n      \"updatedAt\": \"2026-11-19T00:00:00.000Z\"\n    }\n  }\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Iniciar sesión (usuario)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Login de usuario responde 200', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Login devuelve token y usuario sin password', function () {",
                  "  pm.expect(body).to.have.property('status', 'ok');",
                  "  pm.expect(body.data).to.have.property('token');",
                  "  pm.expect(body.data.token).to.be.a('string').and.to.have.lengthOf.at.least(20);",
                  "  pm.expect(body.data).to.have.property('user');",
                  "  pm.expect(body.data.user).to.have.property('role', 'user');",
                  "  pm.expect(body.data.user).to.not.have.property('password');",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "if (body && body.data && body.data.token) {",
                  "  pm.environment.set('token', body.data.token);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"user@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"User123!\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login",
            "description": "Inicia sesión con el usuario demo del seed (`user`). Guarda automáticamente `token` en el entorno para solicitudes de favoritos y `/api/auth/me`.\n\nCredenciales demo locales (solo desarrollo, documentadas en el README)."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "Login exitoso (ejemplo)",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [
                {
